{"steam_appid":1161170,"steam_name":"The Rewinder","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1161170/398993/c38e61e3c380469fe6b7450ad85491f5ec776abb/1750630957/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1630984222","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256850349/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1630984222","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161170/ss_e7e6715d27bddd490b98ceaf5fd4a6ab60b35596.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744993074","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161170/ss_fa721ae7be96be31614612707d3a6922d983dda8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744993074","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161170/ss_c097415a47da891efe14a46512e49a667e18bdef.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744993074","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161170/ss_9c2a345b17fc0025f714da49993a821113fa0df3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744993074","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161170/ss_e560aecb69089bf3c48bde76c76eb622ae3e8356.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744993074"],"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161170/extras/faf9b0304c4267f1f95ffceb3823cd62.webp?t=1744993074\" width=630 height=50 /></span><br>The Rewinder is a 2D puzzle adventure game inspired by traditional Chinese folklore.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161170/extras/441b0a7f1edcad2a58c54439cd4471c2.poster.avif?t=1744993074\" width=622 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161170/extras/441b0a7f1edcad2a58c54439cd4471c2.webm?t=1744993074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161170/extras/441b0a7f1edcad2a58c54439cd4471c2.mp4?t=1744993074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game uses pixel art to mimic the aesthetics of Chinese ink paintings. Players will get to meet mythological figures such as the Spirit Wardens, the Ox-head and Horse-face Guardians of the Beyond, and the Tudi Gong (Keeper of the Land).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161170/extras/6177992f8b89084034e234f6c1a8cd90.webp?t=1744993074\" width=630 height=50 /></span><br>The player takes on the role of Yun, a &quot;rewinder&quot; who has the ability to enter people's memories and influence their actions. By utilizing &quot;senses&quot; and swaying others' &quot;intentions&quot;, he can change history. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161170/extras/29eafa7aefb5123cddf658f0bd2cc294.poster.avif?t=1744993074\" width=630 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161170/extras/29eafa7aefb5123cddf658f0bd2cc294.webm?t=1744993074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161170/extras/29eafa7aefb5123cddf658f0bd2cc294.mp4?t=1744993074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161170/extras/d5e8a194319e5c86628d85f99078e5f2.webp?t=1744993074\" width=630 height=50 /></span><br>At the request of the Spirit Wardens, Yun goes to a small village to investigate why a spirit couldn't be reincarnated. The once thriving village has been deserted and filled with resentful spirits, leaving one woman alone in the teahouse. Who's she waiting for? Where did all the other villagers go? What really happened seven years ago?","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 Quad-Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie"],"developers":["MistyMountainStudio"],"publishers":["Gamirror Games"],"release_date":"9 Sep, 2021"}